      "content": "RRB HIGH-VALUE SUMMARY POINTS"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "m7ubdqg",
      "content": "• 15th FC: 41% devolution to States.<br></br>• Income Distance has highest weight (45%).<br></br>• Debt sustainability depends on GDP growth.<br></br>• Food subsidy is largest in India."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "usdsz58",
      "content": "• Public Finance includes revenue, expenditure and debt.<br></br>• Finance Commission formed under Article 280.<br></br>• Internal vs External debt distinction important.<br></br>• Revenue expenditure does not create assets.<br></br>"
    }
